Headers
Name
Type
Description
x-account-id*

string

Partner account id

x-secret-key*

string

Partner secret key

x-request-id*

string

A unique id identifying this request

Request Body
Name
Type
Description
transactionId*

string

The ID of the transaction returned by the USSD Push endpoint

transactionRef*

string

The reference that was provided in the wallet-to-mobile endpoint

